        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1700/1500;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 5%,#5b3b9a 0%,transparent 45%),linear-gradient(160deg,#1a1230,#2a1b4d);color:#f4efff;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif'><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:3.765cqw;width:52.941cqw;height:2.353cqw;font:800 1.412cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#f5c542'>TWILITE ZONE · THE COMMONS</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:6.941cqw;width:70.588cqw;height:8.824cqw;font:550 7.294cqw/1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em'>The Commons</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:17.059cqw;width:61.765cqw;height:7.647cqw;font:430 2.118cqw/1.4 Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:#d9cdf5'>Other people’s libraries. Each is their own file, kept by them, and you can walk into any of them.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:76.471cqw;top:4.118cqw;width:18.824cqw;height:2.941cqw;font:700 1.529cqw system-ui;text-align:right'><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>← The Twilite Zone</a></div><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:26.471cqw;width:90.588cqw;height:0.235cqw;background:#8d6fd0'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:27.412cqw;width:35.294cqw;height:1.765cqw;font:800 1.176cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#b9a6e6'>PUBLIC SPACES</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:30.588cqw;width:28.235cqw;height:35.294cqw;box-sizing:border-box;background:#ffffff12;border:2px solid #ffffff26;border-radius:1.529cqw'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:6.118cqw;top:48.588cqw;width:25.412cqw;height:1.765cqw;font:800 1.059cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#f5c542'>MIKE MARTINEZ</div><div style='position:absolute;left:6.118cqw;top:50.588cqw;width:25.412cqw;height:3.294cqw;font:560 2.588cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif'>The Studio</div><div style='position:absolute;left:6.118cqw;top:54.706cqw;width:25.412cqw;height:7.647cqw;font:430 1.471cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#d9cdf5'>Projects, news and the workroom behind Twilite. Open it and look around.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:35.882cqw;top:30.588cqw;width:28.235cqw;height:35.294cqw;box-sizing:border-box;background:#ffffff12;border:2px solid #ffffff26;border-radius:1.529cqw'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:37.294cqw;top:48.588cqw;width:25.412cqw;height:1.765cqw;font:800 1.059cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#f5c542'>TWILITE SHOWROOM</div><div style='position:absolute;left:37.294cqw;top:50.588cqw;width:25.412cqw;height:3.294cqw;font:560 2.588cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif'>Blusheree</div><div style='position:absolute;left:37.294cqw;top:54.706cqw;width:25.412cqw;height:7.647cqw;font:430 1.471cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#d9cdf5'>A real storefront, made as a graph. Browse it the way you would a shop.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:67.059cqw;top:30.588cqw;width:28.235cqw;height:35.294cqw;box-sizing:border-box;border:3px dashed #8d6fd0;border-radius:1.529cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:2.353cqw'><div style='font:800 1.059cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#f5c542'>YOURS?</div><div style='font:560 2.588cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:0.824cqw 0'>Room for the next</div><div style='font:430 1.471cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#d9cdf5'>Publish a graph library and it can stand here, beside these.</div></div><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:68.824cqw;width:90.588cqw;height:0.235cqw;background:#8d6fd0'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:70.000cqw;width:35.294cqw;height:1.765cqw;font:800 1.176cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#b9a6e6'>BE LISTED</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4.706cqw;top:73.529cqw;width:3.529cqw;height:3.529cqw;font:800 1.765cqw Georgia,serif;color:#1a1230;background:#f5c542;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>1</div><div style='position:absolute;left:9.529cqw;top:73.294cqw;width:24.706cqw;height:2.588cqw;font:560 2.000cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif'>Publish</div><div style='position:absolute;left:9.529cqw;top:76.235cqw;width:24.706cqw;height:7.647cqw;font:430 1.412cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#d9cdf5'>Put your graphs in a public GitHub repository.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:35.882cqw;top:73.529cqw;width:3.529cqw;height:3.529cqw;font:800 1.765cqw Georgia,serif;color:#1a1230;background:#f5c542;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>2</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40.706cqw;top:73.294cqw;width:24.706cqw;height:2.588cqw;font:560 2.000cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif'>Send it</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40.706cqw;top:76.235cqw;width:24.706cqw;height:7.647cqw;font:430 1.412cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#d9cdf5'>Use Send feedback in the Zone and give us the repository address.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:67.059cqw;top:73.529cqw;width:3.529cqw;height:3.529cqw;font:800 1.765cqw Georgia,serif;color:#1a1230;background:#f5c542;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>3</div><div style='position:absolute;left:71.882cqw;top:73.294cqw;width:24.706cqw;height:2.588cqw;font:560 2.000cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif'>Get a door</div><div style='position:absolute;left:71.882cqw;top:76.235cqw;width:24.706cqw;height:7.647cqw;font:430 1.412cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#d9cdf5'>A door is added here. The files stay yours, always.</div></div>"
        }
